      "date": "2026-05-31T05:57:09.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹86.99 (vs ₹102 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹86.99 (down from ₹102 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹4.58b (up 38% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹658.4m (down 15% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 23% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 16% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
