      "title": "The Sandesh Limited Recommends Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "The Sandesh Limited at its meeting held on May 29, 2026, recommended a dividend of 50% that is INR 5/- (Rupees Five Only) per Equity Share of Face Value of INR 10/- each of the Company for the Financial Year ended March 31, 2026, subject to the approval of the shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting (\"AGM\") and that the said dividend would be paid within 30 days from the date of declaration at the AGM. Company shall inform in due course of the date on which the Company will hold its AGM for the Financial Year ended March 31, 2026, and the date from which the dividend, if approved by the shareholders, will be paid.",
